              "id": "text_Q80wNh1U",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 500,
              "top": 170,
              "width": 420,
              "height": 94,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>变量声明格式：</strong>type variableName = value;</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>命名规范：</strong>驼峰命名法（如 studentName）</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>String 类型：</strong>引用类型，String s = \"Hello\";</p>",
