          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "text_Af_oXjwu",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 50,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 70,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 32px;\"><strong>简单输入输出</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1a1a1a",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "shape_P7gVt4Rb",
              "type": "shape",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 128,
              "width": 200,
              "height": 3,
              "path": "M 0 0 L 1 0 L 1 1 L 0 1 Z",
              "viewBox": [
                1,
                1
              ],
              "fill": "#5b9bd5",
              "fixedRatio": false,
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_7MJHA-1u",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 145,
              "width": 420,
              "height": 103,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>输出 (println)</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">System.out.println(\"Hello\");</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#555;\">将内容打印到控制台</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_3eR3a635",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 264,
              "width": 420,
              "height": 103,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>输入 (Scanner)</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#555;\">读取用户输入</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_-zfAUMVy",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 520,
              "top": 145,
              "width": 420,
              "height": 76,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>import 语句</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">import java.util.Scanner;</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_b1DJ5fDU",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 520,
              "top": 237,
              "width": 420,
              "height": 76,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>类型转换</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">int num = Integer.parseInt(sc.nextLine());</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "line_8FSeACcP",
              "type": "line",
              "left": 500,
              "top": 145,
              "width": 2,
              "start": [
                0,
                0
              ],
              "end": [
                0,
                222
              ],
              "style": "solid",
              "color": "#e0e0e0",
              "points": [
                "",
                ""
              ],
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_qVhm1_Ou",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_Af_oXjwu"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_wJ1OR_K9",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "接下来，我们来学习Java中的简单输入输出，这是编写交互程序的基础。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_mU_Ts_ul",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_7MJHA-1u"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_zEqp8SgD",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "首先看输出，使用System.out.println就可以把内容打印到控制台，比如输出一个Hello。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_Pn7mRnbS",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_3eR3a635"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_3yxJV64s",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "如果想要让程序接收用户的输入，就需要用到Scanner类，这里创建了一个Scanner对象，关联到System.in。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_bjvDF3w7",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_-zfAUMVy"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_YH1AN7rN",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "注意，使用Scanner之前必须加上import语句，import java.util.Scanner; 来导入这个类。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_fScdtFIa",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_b1DJ5fDU"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_5zQrlf3O",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "最后，当我们用Scanner读取到一行文本后，常常需要把它转换成其他数据类型，比如int，这时可以用Integer.parseInt来完成类型转换。"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1780134643397,
      "updatedAt": 1780134643397
    }
